You got your smarts from me!

1063
01:26:30,852 --> 01:26:31,895
I call.

1064
01:26:35,315 --> 01:26:37,358
Wow, you call.

1065
01:26:37,442 --> 01:26:38,484
Okay.

1066
01:26:38,985 --> 01:26:40,528
Let's see who's ball it is.

1067
01:26:49,162 --> 01:26:52,081
Missed. It's my ball.

1068
01:26:52,665 --> 01:26:54,834
Yes, that's why you call it a miss.

1069
01:26:54,918 --> 01:26:57,003
I missed. Ha ha ha, I'm so funny.

1070
01:27:06,554 --> 01:27:07,555
How are you even gay?

1071
01:27:07,639 --> 01:27:09,140
You're so good at this.

1072
01:27:09,224 --> 01:27:11,684
There're plenty of gay players.

1073
01:27:12,518 --> 01:27:14,354
They just afraid to come out
because of people like you.

1074
01:27:14,437 --> 01:27:16,898
Oh wow, so it's my fault they're gay.

1075
01:27:22,862 --> 01:27:24,322
Gosh, kid.

1076
01:27:24,405 --> 01:27:26,366
Of all the things you
could have bet your life on,

1077
01:27:26,449 --> 01:27:27,742
you picked basketball.

1078
01:27:27,825 --> 01:27:29,827
Did you forget your dad was a pro?

1079
01:27:29,911 --> 01:27:31,663
Oops!

1080
01:27:40,088 --> 01:27:42,048
Three-One!

1081
01:27:42,131 --> 01:27:44,467
That means I'm up by…

1082
01:27:45,134 --> 01:27:46,511
Two.

1083
01:28:29,387 --> 01:28:32,056
What kind of girl do you want?
A fair one or a dark one?

1084
01:28:40,189 --> 01:28:41,607
An asian guy.

1085
01:28:51,284 --> 01:28:52,118
A tie!

1086
01:28:54,495 --> 01:28:55,997
I'm getting a grandchild!

1087
01:28:56,080 --> 01:28:57,707
And I'd like a baby girl.

1088
01:29:04,005 --> 01:29:06,215
