1089
01:29:07,842 --> 01:29:08,968
It's not that!

1090
01:29:10,094 --> 01:29:12,180
Even if I win,

1091
01:29:12,680 --> 01:29:13,806
I'm leaving your house for good

1092
01:29:13,890 --> 01:29:16,517
