be talking shit about me!

1093
01:29:17,018 --> 01:29:18,186
It just hurts!

1094
01:29:18,269 --> 01:29:20,188
You?! You're hurt?

1095
01:29:20,271 --> 01:29:21,773
Don't you think I'm hurt, too?!

1096
01:29:21,856 --> 01:29:23,066
My only son,

1097
01:29:23,149 --> 01:29:24,484
