1185
01:37:00,481 --> 01:37:02,650
Thank you, Lord, for the gift of music

1186
01:37:02,733 --> 01:37:04,902
and the opportunity to perform.

1187
01:37:05,611 --> 01:37:09,365
May our talents bring glory to your name.

1188
01:37:09,448 --> 01:37:11,575
This we ask, through Jesus Christ.

1189
01:37:11,659 --> 01:37:13,202
- Amen.
- Amen!

